   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project comprises a consultancy mission to Taj with the task to:Describe, to the extent possible, the strategy of the Gov as regards the land reform.Gather information about other donor&#x2019;s activities pertaining to land reform and analyse their implications for the Swedish cadastral project and the project targets.Where needed, make proposals on necessary changes or additions to the ongoi</narrative>
